   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"4\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>The function, <span data-math=\"f\">f</span>, gives the number of copies of a book that have sold <span data-math=\"w\">w</span> weeks after it was published. The equation <span data-math=\"f(w)=500 \\cdot 2^w\">f(w)=500 \\cdot 2^w</span> defines this function. <strong>Select two</strong> domains for which the average rate of change could be a good measure for the number of books sold.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"0 \\leq w \\leq 2\">0 \\leq w \\leq 2</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"0 \\leq w \\leq 7\">0 \\leq w \\leq 7</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"5 \\leq w \\leq 7\">5 \\leq w \\leq 7</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"5 \\leq w \\leq 10\">5 \\leq w \\leq 10</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"0 \\leq w \\leq 10\">0 \\leq w \\leq 10</span></li>\n</ol>",
